    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "lsp_text",
      "x": 84,
      "y": 782,
      "width": 652,
      "height": 496,
      "text": "LSP + Formatting + Git\\n\\nLSP attach maps\\n- gd definition | gD declaration | gI implementation | gr references\\n- K hover | ␠D type definition\\n- ␠lr rename | ␠la code action\\n- ␠lf format buffer | ␠ls signature help\\n- ␠lq diagnostics -> location list\\n- ␠th toggle inlay hints\\n\\nConform.nvim\\n- ␠cf -> format buffer now\\n- ␠uf -> toggle autoformat\\n- :FormatToggle -> global toggle\\n- :FormatToggle! -> buffer-local toggle\\n\\nGitsigns.nvim\\n- ]h / [h -> next / prev hunk\\n- ␠hs stage hunk\\n- ␠hr reset hunk\\n- ␠hu undo stage hunk\\n- ␠hp preview hunk\\n- ␠hb blame line\\n- ␠hd diff this\\n\\nBackground support\\n- nvim-lspconfig | mason.nvim | mason-lspconfig.nvim\\n- lazydev.nvim for Lua dev UX",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "lsp_box",
      "originalText": "LSP + Formatting + Git\\n\\nLSP attach maps\\n- gd definition | gD declaration | gI implementation | gr references\\n- K hover | ␠D type definition\\n- ␠lr rename | ␠la code action\\n- ␠lf format buffer | ␠ls signature help\\n- ␠lq diagnostics -> location list\\n- ␠th toggle inlay hints\\n\\nConform.nvim\\n- ␠cf -> format buffer now\\n- ␠uf -> toggle autoformat\\n- :FormatToggle -> global toggle\\n- :FormatToggle! -> buffer-local toggle\\n\\nGitsigns.nvim\\n- ]h / [h -> next / prev hunk\\n- ␠hs stage hunk\\n- ␠hr reset hunk\\n- ␠hu undo stage hunk\\n- ␠hp preview hunk\\n- ␠hb blame line\\n- ␠hd diff this\\n\\nBackground support\\n- nvim-lspconfig | mason.nvim | mason-lspconfig.nvim\\n- lazydev.nvim for Lua dev UX",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
