    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "ai_text",
      "x": 1424,
      "y": 782,
      "width": 492,
      "height": 856,
      "text": "AI / Agent Plugin Surface\\n\\nCodeCompanion.nvim\\n- ␠cc toggle chat [N/V]\\n- ␠ca actions [N/V]\\n- ␠ci inline [N/V]\\n- ga add selection to chat [V]\\n\\nagentic.nvim\\n- ⌃\\\\ toggle panel [N/V/I]\\n- ⌃' add file / selection context [N/V]\\n- ⌃, new session [N/V/I]\\n\\nAugment.vim\\n- ␠as status\\n- ␠ai sign in\\n- ␠ao sign out\\n- ␠ac chat\\n- ␠an new chat\\n- ␠at toggle chat\\n- ␠al log\\n\\nMCP / diff hooks\\n- ␠mh MCP Hub\\n- ␠opc install Claude hooks\\n- ␠opo install OpenCode hooks\\n- ␠opx install Codex hooks\\n\\nProvider bridges\\n- ␠oC Claude Code\\n- ␠oF Claude Focus\\n- ␠oS send to Claude [V]\\n- ␠oo OpenCode toggle [N/T]\\n- ␠oa Ask OpenCode [N/V]\\n- ␠os OpenCode action [N/V]\\n- ␠oc Send to OpenCode [N/V]\\n- ␠ox Codex toggle [N/T]\\n- ␠og Gemini sidebar\\n- ␠oG Gemini CLI\\n- ␠om Send to Gemini [V]",
      "fontSize": 18,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "ai_box",
      "originalText": "AI / Agent Plugin Surface\\n\\nCodeCompanion.nvim\\n- ␠cc toggle chat [N/V]\\n- ␠ca actions [N/V]\\n- ␠ci inline [N/V]\\n- ga add selection to chat [V]\\n\\nagentic.nvim\\n- ⌃\\\\ toggle panel [N/V/I]\\n- ⌃' add file / selection context [N/V]\\n- ⌃, new session [N/V/I]\\n\\nAugment.vim\\n- ␠as status\\n- ␠ai sign in\\n- ␠ao sign out\\n- ␠ac chat\\n- ␠an new chat\\n- ␠at toggle chat\\n- ␠al log\\n\\nMCP / diff hooks\\n- ␠mh MCP Hub\\n- ␠opc install Claude hooks\\n- ␠opo install OpenCode hooks\\n- ␠opx install Codex hooks\\n\\nProvider bridges\\n- ␠oC Claude Code\\n- ␠oF Claude Focus\\n- ␠oS send to Claude [V]\\n- ␠oo OpenCode toggle [N/T]\\n- ␠oa Ask OpenCode [N/V]\\n- ␠os OpenCode action [N/V]\\n- ␠oc Send to OpenCode [N/V]\\n- ␠ox Codex toggle [N/T]\\n- ␠og Gemini sidebar\\n- ␠oG Gemini CLI\\n- ␠om Send to Gemini [V]",
